{"seq":3,"slug":"oversell-prevention-drift-reconciliation","title":"超卖防控、断货降级与库存漂移对账修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/inventory-price-sync/oversell-prevention-drift-reconciliation","wordCount":2764,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"超卖防控-断货降级与库存漂移对账修复\">超卖防控、断货降级与库存漂移对账修复</h1><p>库存同步做对了协同语义，只解决了一半问题：剩下的那一半是<strong>当同步不可避免地失败时，系统怎么办</strong>。代发链路的供给真相掌握在供应商手里，你既不能强制它及时推送，也不能保证它的数字是对的；能控制的只有三件事——把超卖挡在下单之前、在断货被确认时选一条代价最小的降级路径、以及用周期对账把已经悄悄累积的偏差收敛回来。本文把这三件事拆成可实施的防线、阶梯与修复剧本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三道防线与漂移的定义\">核心概念：三道防线与漂移的定义</h2><p>超卖防控不是一道闸门，而是三层防御，每层的失效模式与代价完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防线</th>\n<th>作用时刻</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>失效表现</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预防</td>\n<td>下单前</td>\n<td>本地可售量 + 缓冲 + 限流</td>\n<td>缓冲过紧 → 少卖</td>\n<td>毛利损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级</td>\n<td>断货确认时</td>\n<td>改单/预售/换供/退款</td>\n<td>降级策略缺失 → 静默取消</td>\n<td>客户信任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对账修复</td>\n<td>事后周期</td>\n<td>全量比对 + 差异修正</td>\n<td>无对账 → 偏差单调累积</td>\n<td>系统性超卖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三层常被忽略，因为它的收益是「没发生的事」。但漂移（drift）是一个<strong>单调累积的过程</strong>：本地可售量与供应商真实可售量之间的差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在没有修正项时会随机游走，其期望绝对值随时间增长。设每步同步的偏差均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_k = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\epsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2887em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}(d_k) = k\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，漂移的标准差按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长。对账修复的作用是周期性地把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 强制拉回零附近，把无界随机游走变成有界过程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></munderover><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>recon</mtext></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sync</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|d_t| \\le \\Delta_{\\max} = \\max_{i \\le k}\\Bigl|\\sum_{j=1}^{i}\\epsilon_j\\Bigr|,\\quad k = \\frac{T_{\\text{recon}}}{T_{\\text{sync}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2254em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8117em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recon</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>recon</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{recon}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recon</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对账周期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sync</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sync}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单次同步间隔。这个式子给出了对账频率的下界直觉：<strong>同步越频繁、单次越不可靠，对账必须越勤</strong>。供应商推送「早上有货、下午售罄」这类日内高频波动，正是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sync</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sync}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压得很小、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>recon</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{recon}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recon</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 却常被设成一天一次的组合（DSers 的库存自动同步产品说明直接描述了这一现象，来源：<a href=\"https://help.dsers.com/inventory-auto-sync-prevent-overselling/）。\">https://help.dsers.com/inventory-auto-sync-prevent-overselling/）。</a></p>\n<p>漂移按成因分三类，处理方式不能混为一谈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漂移类型</th>\n<th>成因举例</th>\n<th>是否可用增量修复</th>\n<th>检测手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数值漂移</td>\n<td>事件丢失、幂等键缺失导致重复扣减</td>\n<td>可，重放或补一条修正事件</td>\n<td>定期全量比对的差值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构漂移</td>\n<td>SKU 映射改了、供应商拆了变体</td>\n<td>否，需重映射</td>\n<td>对账时出现无对应项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义漂移</td>\n<td>供应商把单位从「箱」改成「件」、把 <code>available</code> 改成含缓冲口径</td>\n<td>否，需重建口径</td>\n<td>比值恒定偏移、量级突变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结构漂移与语义漂移的共同点是：<strong>它们不会让数字「错一点」，而是让数字整体偏移一个倍数或错位到错误对象上</strong>。这类偏差无法靠增量事件补正，只能靠全量对账识别出「比例异常」或「孤立项」。这也解释了对账不能只比总量——总量相等但内部换了对象，是典型的语义漂移掩盖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[周期对账触发] --&gt; B[拉取供应商全量快照]&#10;  B --&gt; C[按 item+location+name 三元组匹配]&#10;  C --&gt; D{差异分类}&#10;  D --&gt;|数值差异| E[生成修正事件&lt;br/&gt;走 CAS 写入]&#10;  D --&gt;|孤立项/无对应| F[结构漂移&lt;br/&gt;标记待重映射]&#10;  D --&gt;|比值恒定偏移| G[语义漂移&lt;br/&gt;告警并冻结该SKU前台暴露]&#10;  E --&gt; H[写入后复读校验]&#10;  H --&gt; I[发布到前台]&#10;  F --&gt; J[人工/规则重映射后再纳入]&#10;  G --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[周期对账触发] --&gt; B[拉取供应商全量快照]\n  B --&gt; C[按 item+location+name 三元组匹配]\n  C --&gt; D{差异分类}\n  D --&gt;|数值差异| E[生成修正事件&lt;br/&gt;走 CAS 写入]\n  D --&gt;|孤立项/无对应| F[结构漂移&lt;br/&gt;标记待重映射]\n  D --&gt;|比值恒定偏移| G[语义漂移&lt;br/&gt;告警并冻结该SKU前台暴露]\n  E --&gt; H[写入后复读校验]\n  H --&gt; I[发布到前台]\n  F --&gt; J[人工/规则重映射后再纳入]\n  G --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"断货降级策略阶梯\">断货降级策略阶梯</h2><p>当对账或事件明确判定某 SKU 断货（供应商 <code>available</code> 归零或低于阈值），系统必须立刻选一条降级路径，而不是让订单继续落到一个无货的漏斗里。降级空间是一个从「保全客户」到「保全现金」的阶梯，越靠下对客户伤害越大、对你的操作成本越低：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[断货确认] --&gt; Q1{客户是否已知晓发货时间?}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|否, 可悄悄处理| Q2{有等价替代供给?}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|是, 已承诺| Q3{可补货时间 T 是否可接受?}&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|有| A[自动换供&lt;br/&gt;同款其他供应商]&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|无| B[拆单&lt;br/&gt;有货部分先发]&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|T 短| C[转预售/延迟发货&lt;br/&gt;主动告知新 ETA]&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|T 长| D{差价是否可吸收?}&#10;  D --&gt;|可| E[升级发货&lt;br/&gt;用本地高价库存兜底]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[主动取消 + 补偿&lt;br/&gt;退款/优惠券]&#10;  B --&gt; G[无货部分进入待补队列]&#10;  A --&gt; H[重路由到新供应商]&#10;  E --&gt; I[差额计入履约成本]&#10;  F --&gt; J[记录断货事件&lt;br/&gt;反馈给选品]\">graph TD\n  S[断货确认] --&gt; Q1{客户是否已知晓发货时间?}\n  Q1 --&gt;|否, 可悄悄处理| Q2{有等价替代供给?}\n  Q1 --&gt;|是, 已承诺| Q3{可补货时间 T 是否可接受?}\n  Q2 --&gt;|有| A[自动换供&lt;br/&gt;同款其他供应商]\n  Q2 --&gt;|无| B[拆单&lt;br/&gt;有货部分先发]\n  Q3 --&gt;|T 短| C[转预售/延迟发货&lt;br/&gt;主动告知新 ETA]\n  Q3 --&gt;|T 长| D{差价是否可吸收?}\n  D --&gt;|可| E[升级发货&lt;br/&gt;用本地高价库存兜底]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[主动取消 + 补偿&lt;br/&gt;退款/优惠券]\n  B --&gt; G[无货部分进入待补队列]\n  A --&gt; H[重路由到新供应商]\n  E --&gt; I[差额计入履约成本]\n  F --&gt; J[记录断货事件&lt;br/&gt;反馈给选品]</pre><p>这条阶梯的两个工程要点：</p>\n<p><strong>一是每一步都必须幂等且可回退。</strong> 自动换供本质是一次订单重路由，换供后原供应商可能又恢复供货——此时不能自动换回，否则两个供应商的占用同时挂在一张订单上。做法是给睡眠状态机加显式的 <code>pending_reassign</code> 中间态，换供确认（新供应商回传发货号）之前不放行原占用释放。这与库存事件的幂等契约同源，参见 <a href=\"inventory-realtime-sync-model\">库存实时同步模型与一致性语义</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>二是降级的触发阈值必须比对账结果更保守。</strong> 断言「断货」是一个高代价动作（换供有差价、取消伤客户），不能仅凭一次事件推送就执行。稳妥的判据是「连续 N 次同步读数低于阈值」或「对账快照确认 + 事件确认一致」，即要求两个独立来源同时指向断货。单一来源的瞬时归零在代发链路里极其常见——供应商的库存接口抖动、临时下架、批量导出中断都会让 <code>available</code> 假性归零。把假归零当成真断货去自动取消订单，是比超卖更贵的事故。</p>\n<p>替代供给的可用性判断本身也要落到可售量模型上：换供不是「另一个供应商有这个 SKU」就够，而是它的 ATP 必须足以承诺这笔单——决策要读新供应商的 <code>available − safety_stock</code>，而不是它的 <code>on_hand</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账修复的安全边界与防振荡\">对账修复的安全边界与防振荡</h2><p>对账的朴素实现是「以供应商为准，把本地值覆盖成供应商值」。这在代发场景里是错的，因为<strong>本地持有供应商看不到的状态</strong>：本地已下单未发货的 <code>committed</code>、本地缓冲、以及正在进行的降级流程。直接覆盖会把这些本地承诺抹掉，等于人为制造超卖。</p>\n<p>安全性要求修复方向<strong>单向收敛到一个自洽口径</strong>，而不是双向覆盖。定义本地目标值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>target_available</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> supplier_on_hand</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>supplier_committed</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>local_committed</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{target\\_available} = \\max\\bigl(0,\\ \\text{supplier\\_on\\_hand} - \\text{supplier\\_committed} - \\text{local\\_committed} - B\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">target_available</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supplier_on_hand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supplier_committed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">local_committed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当供应商快照同时给了 <code>on_hand</code> 与它自己的 <code>committed</code> 时，这个式子才成立；若供应商只给一个已经扣好缓冲的 <code>available</code>，再用上式会双扣（见前文对 <code>available</code> 内置缓冲的提醒）。因此修复剧本的第一步是<strong>确认口径</strong>，第二步才是算差值，第三步是<strong>校验差值是否落在合理范围</strong>——如果一次对账算出的修正量超过该 SKU 日均销量的若干倍，应当挂起并告警而不是直接写入，因为那大概率是口径变化或映射错误，不是真实库存变动。</p>\n<p>防振荡是修复剧本的另一条硬约束。若对账周期短于供应商库存的稳定周期，会出现「对账写入 → 供应商下一拍又变 → 再对账写入」的来回拉扯，本地可售量反复跳变，前台展示闪烁、缓存全部失效。约束是：<strong>修复只允许把本地值向供应商方向单步靠拢，且单位时间内对单个 SKU 的修复次数设上限</strong>。这与 TCP 拥塞控制里「收紧立即、放宽滞后」的不对称性同源（RFC 5681，<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）——收紧本地暴露量（少卖）可以立刻做，放宽暴露量（多卖）必须等连续多次对账都确认供给恢复才做，避免一次假恢复把缓冲掏空。\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）——收紧本地暴露量（少卖）可以立刻做，放宽暴露量（多卖）必须等连续多次对账都确认供给恢复才做，避免一次假恢复把缓冲掏空。</a></p>\n<p>写入环节仍要用比较交换与幂等键。Shopify 的 <code>inventorySetQuantities</code> 提供 CAS 语义，2026-01 起用 <code>changeFromQuantity</code> 显式声明比较检查、旧 <code>compareQuantity</code>/<code>ignoreCompareQuantity</code> 废弃，2026-04 起旧字段移除且 <code>inventoryAdjustQuantities</code> 强制携带 <code>@idempotent</code> 键（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/changelog/compare-and-swap-redesign-for-inventory-set-quantities）。对账修复脚本在重试时必须带同一个幂等键，否则一次网络超时重试就会把修正量扣两遍。幂等键用随机\">https://shopify.dev/changelog/compare-and-swap-redesign-for-inventory-set-quantities）。对账修复脚本在重试时必须带同一个幂等键，否则一次网络超时重试就会把修正量扣两遍。幂等键用随机</a> UUID 的通用做法见 <a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/usage/idempotent-requests。\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/usage/idempotent-requests。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"监控指标与-slo\">监控指标与 SLO</h2><p>三道防线各自的健康度必须可观测，否则「没出事」与「防线早就没在工作」无法区分。核心指标与判读方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>期望方向</th>\n<th>异常信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超卖率</td>\n<td>取消/重路由订单 ÷ 总订单</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n<td>突然抬升 → 缓冲或延迟失守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对账差异率</td>\n<td>有差异的 SKU 数 ÷ 比对总数</td>\n<td>稳定低位</td>\n<td>持续上升 → 同步链路退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂移量分位</td>\n<td>单个 SKU 的 |local − supplier| 的 p95</td>\n<td>有界</td>\n<td>p95 触顶 Δmax → 对账周期过长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复写入量</td>\n<td>每轮对账的修正事件数</td>\n<td>平稳</td>\n<td>脉冲式 → 口径变化/映射错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假断货率</td>\n<td>触发降级但 24h 内供给恢复的比例</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高 → 断货判据过于激进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级 MTTD/MTTR</td>\n<td>从断货到降级动作完成的时延</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>长 → 阶梯决策链路有阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>要特别盯<strong>对账差异率</strong>与<strong>假断货率</strong>这对反向指标：把断货阈值调松会降低假断货率，但会让超卖率上升；把对账周期调短会压低漂移量，但会抬高修复写入量与振荡风险。两个指标同时恶化，说明问题不在参数而在链路本身（例如供应商改了接口口径），此时应升级到结构/语义漂移的处理路径。</p>\n<p>行业量级参考：一份 2026 年的统计给出代发卖家平均 15–20% 的断货率（来源：WorldMetrics「Dropshipping Industry Statistics: 2026 Market Report」，<a href=\"https://worldmetrics.org/dropshipping-industry-statistics/）。这个数字应作为「不做防控会怎样」的基线，而不是目标值。\">https://worldmetrics.org/dropshipping-industry-statistics/）。这个数字应作为「不做防控会怎样」的基线，而不是目标值。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>超卖防控是<strong>三道防线</strong>：下单前的缓冲与限流、断货确认时的降级阶梯、事后的周期对账修复。第三层缺失会让偏差按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 单调累积。</li>\n<li>漂移分<strong>数值/结构/语义</strong>三类。数值漂移可按增量修正，结构与语义漂移必须靠全量对账识别「比值恒定偏移」或「孤立项」，无法用补一条事件解决。</li>\n<li>断货降级是一条从「自动换供/拆单」到「主动取消 + 补偿」的阶梯；每一步要幂等可回退，且断货判据必须要求<strong>两个独立来源一致</strong>，避免把假性归零当成真断货。</li>\n<li>对账修复禁止双向覆盖：本地持有供应商看不见的 <code>committed</code> 与缓冲，覆盖等于制造超卖。修复方向应是单向收敛到一个显式口径，并对单 SKU 的修复频率设上限以防振荡。</li>\n<li>缓冲调整沿用「收紧立即、放宽滞后」的不对称策略（RFC 5681 的 AIMD 同源）；写入始终用 CAS + 幂等键，适配 Shopify 2026 年的 <code>changeFromQuantity</code> / <code>@idempotent</code> 变更。</li>\n<li>监控要同时看<strong>对账差异率</strong>与<strong>假断货率</strong>：两者同时恶化说明链路本身出错，调参无效，应升级到结构/语义漂移的处理路径。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文处理「同步失败之后怎么办」；同步本身的建模、ATP 推导与一致性语义见 <a href=\"inventory-realtime-sync-model\">库存实时同步模型与一致性语义</a>，供应商能力分级见 <a href=\"../dropship-model-supplier-network/dropship-fulfillment-models-taxonomy\">代发履约模式与商业模型分类</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超卖防控、断货降级与库存漂移对账修复","id":"超卖防控-断货降级与库存漂移对账修复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三道防线与漂移的定义","id":"核心概念-三道防线与漂移的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"断货降级策略阶梯","id":"断货降级策略阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"对账修复的安全边界与防振荡","id":"对账修复的安全边界与防振荡"},{"level":2,"text":"监控指标与 SLO","id":"监控指标与-slo"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价目与成本同步管道（API 拉取/Feed 文件/Webhook 推送与频次权衡）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/inventory-price-sync/price-cost-sync-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"订单路由决策模型与候选供应商选择（成本/时效/库存/评分多目标）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/order-routing-blind-fulfillment/order-routing-decision-model"}}